 <tr class="bg-slate-50"><td class="p-3 font-bold">UE</td><td class="p-3">NANDO, EU Safety Gate (RAPEX)</td><td class="p-3">Organismo notificado, alertas de producto</td></tr>
 <tr class="bg-white"><td class="p-3 font-bold">Reino Unido</td><td class="p-3">UKCA</td><td class="p-3">Marcado UKCA</td></tr>
